osable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1328,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1015,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[937,"**Composable rows**: Each `MenuItem` renders a string label or composed content (icons, checkboxes). Use render props (`isSelected`, `selectionMode`) and pass `textValue` for typeahead."],[1330,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[913,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[753,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[911,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1019,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1332,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1544,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1577,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1543,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[849,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[219,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[218,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[274,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[741,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[216,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[743,"**DOM Output:**"],[688,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1572,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[759,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[747,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[732,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[681,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1335,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[735,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[233,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[955,"**Group headings**: The group `Heading` receives `role=\"presentation\"` automatically and acts as a label for the group, not a real heading level."],[245,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[248,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[237,"**Horizon