gs are presentational."],[763,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[239,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[962,"**Mobile**: Replace `MenuTrigger` + `Popover` with `Drawer` on narrow viewports; reuse the same `Menu`."],[1545,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[757,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1150,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[679,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[744,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[940,"**Popover or drawer**: Open from `MenuTrigger` for positioned overlays, or place `Menu` in a `Drawer` for full-screen/mobile."],[761,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[754,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1181,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1180,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[914,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1336,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[868,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[745,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[740,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[215,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[246,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing