e: one for single dates and two for ranges by default."],[1045,"`PaginationDots` is decorative and does not replace interactive page\ncontrols."],[806,"`placement` does not flip in RTL; the side is decided by document/flex order."],[794,"`placement` selects the collapse axis (`left`/`right` → width, `top`/`bottom` → height)"],[1062,"`PopoverTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Popover>`, handling open state and positioning automatically.\nBased on RAC `DialogTrigger`. To anchor a popover to an element it doesn't wrap, pass `triggerRef` instead.\nA parent can set `hideArrow` and `containerProps` through `PopoverContext`. Props on `Popover` still win."],[797,"`prefers-reduced-motion` support"],[1090,"`Pressable` accepts the React Aria press props, including `onPress`, `onPressStart`, `onPressEnd`, `onPressUp`, and `onPressChange`."],[1095,"`Pressable` automatically applies React Aria state attributes such as `[data-hovered]`, `[data-pressed]`, `[data-focus-visible]`, and `[data-disabled]` to the child. Ensure the child component styles these states appropriately if it overrides the default `Pressable` styles."],[1178,"`RadioGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Radio` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Radio` takes label text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."],[1003,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[1067,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[569,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"],[720,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[719,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[460,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[118